  <title>Selection and Iteration</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      This unit introduces students to selection for decision-making and iteration for 
      repetition in code. 
    </p>

    <p>
      <ul>


        <li>
          <p>Instructional days: 23-25 days (45 minutes per day)</p>
        </li>

        <li>
          <p>
            Time Estimates: 90 minutes for most lessons, except 45 mins for 2.2.
          </p>
        </li>

       
      </ul>
    </p>
  </introduction>
 

